{"id":"658854","name":"肥牛滑蛋","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/658854/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"肥牛","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"适量肥牛先解冻备用。","img":"images/658854/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洋葱洗净切细备用。","img":"images/658854/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"碗中打入鸡蛋，加上少量清水搅拌均匀备用。","img":"images/658854/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"碗里适量生抽，蚝油，少量清水一起搅拌均匀备用。","img":"images/658854/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中热油放入洋葱。","img":"images/658854/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"均匀铺上肥牛。","img":"images/658854/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"淋上一半酱汁。","img":"images/658854/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盖上将肥牛焖至八成熟左右。","img":"images/658854/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"均匀倒入鸡蛋液。","img":"images/658854/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入剩下的酱汁，煎至鸡蛋定型。","img":"images/658854/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"翻一翻面再煎二三十秒即可，加入少量葱花出锅。","img":"images/658854/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658854/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658854/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658854/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658854/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}